# Accessibility

- Do not strip Radix or shadcn ARIA, roles, or keyboard handlers to "simplify" a primitive.
- Icon-only buttons have `aria-label`. Text on the button is the label; do not add a redundant `aria-label`.
- Every input has a visible `<label>` or `aria-labelledby`. Placeholder is not a label.
- Interactive elements keep `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring`.
- One `h1` per page. Do not skip heading levels.
- Async status (saved, error, loading finished) goes in a live region, not only a color change.
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`. Do not autoplay motion that cannot be reduced.
- Contrast comes from semantic tokens. Do not hardcode a gray that fails on the dark theme.

Recipes: `skills/create-react-component/references/a11y.md`.
